# Machine Learning:-
-> ml is a method where the computers learn the pattens from data and use those Patterns to make a Predictions without being explicitly programmed for every situations.


--->> Data Type
1) Label Data
2) Unlabel Data


-->>Types Of ML
1) Supervised Learning
-The Model Learns From Labeled Data
-That Means We already know the Correct answer/output.
-Used For 
 - Classification
 - Regression

2) Unsupervised Learning
- the data has no target/Label.
- The model tries to discover hidden patterns or groups

->Common Algorithm
 - K-means Clustering
 - PCA

3)Reinforcement Learning
-An Agent Learns by Interacting With an environment


